=BRAND: {{ $("Social Settings").first().json.brand_name || "the brand" }}
BRAND VOICE: {{ $("Social Settings").first().json.brand_voice }}
PLATFORMS: {{ $json.platforms.join(", ") }}
MEDIA: {{ $json.media_type }}
LINK: {{ $json.link || "none" }}
CAPTION MODE: {{ $json.ai_captions ? "WRITE native captions for each platform" : "AS-IS: keep the user's text exactly, only add suitable hashtags" }}
{{ $json.campaign_context ? "CAMPAIGN DIRECTION: " + $json.campaign_context : "" }}

BRIEF / TEXT:
{{ $json.brief }}

Rules: Facebook - conversational, 1-3 short paragraphs, can include the link, 0-3 hashtags. Instagram - strong first line hook, line breaks, emojis in moderation, 5-12 relevant hashtags at the end, links do not work in captions (say "link in bio"). TikTok - max 150 characters plus 3-5 trending hashtags. Only fill the platforms listed; leave others empty. Suggest the best posting time for the target market.

JSON shape:
{"facebook":{"caption":""},"instagram":{"caption":"","first_comment":""},"tiktok":{"caption":""},"best_time":"","notes":""}
Return ONLY one valid JSON object. Write captions in {{ $json.language }}{{ $json.language === "Arabic (Egyptian)" ? " (natural Egyptian colloquial Arabic)" : "" }}.

